## Convenciones de Nomenclatura

| Elemento | Convención | Ejemplo |
|---|---|---|
| **Componentes** | PascalCase + sufijo Component | `CandidateListComponent`, `HeaderComponent` |
| **Services** | PascalCase + sufijo Service | `CandidateService`, `AuthService` |
| **Pipes** | lowercase + sufijo pipe | `safe-html.pipe.ts` |
| **Directives** | lowercase + sufijo directive | `has-permission.directive.ts` |
| **Guards** | lowercase + sufijo guard | `auth.guard.ts` |
| **Interceptors** | lowercase + sufijo interceptor | `error.interceptor.ts` |
| **Models/Interfaces** | PascalCase, singular, sufijo Model/DTO | `CandidateModel`, `UserDTO` |
| **Archivos TS** | kebab-case | `candidate-list.component.ts`, `auth.service.ts` |
| **Archivos HTML** | kebab-case | `candidate-list.component.html` |
| **Archivos SCSS** | kebab-case | `candidate-list.component.scss` |
| **Variables (TypeScript)** | camelCase | `candidateId`, `isLoading` |
| **Constantes** | UPPER_SNAKE_CASE | `MAX_RETRIES`, `API_TIMEOUT` |

---

## Reglas de Arquitectura Enforzables

### 1. Importación entre Capas
```typescript
// ✅ PERMITIDO
import { CandidateService } from '@app/features/candidates/services';
import { ButtonComponent } from '@app/shared/components';
import { AuthService } from '@app/core/services';

// ❌ PROHIBIDO (feature importa otra feature)
import { AuditService } from '@app/features/audits/services'; // ← Desde candidates/

// ❌ PROHIBIDO (importar interno de feature)
import { CandidateCardComponent } from '@app/features/candidates/components/candidate-card';
// → Usar barrel: import { CandidateCardComponent } from '@app/features/candidates';
```

### 2. Organización interna de Features
```
features/[feature-name]/
├── components/          # Presentational (dumb) components
├── containers/          # Smart components (conectan a store/services)
├── services/            # API calls, business logic
├── models/              # TypeScript interfaces
└── index.ts             # Exporta SOLO el contenedor principal
```

### 3. Barrel Files (`index.ts`)
- **core/index.ts**: Exporta guards, interceptores, servicios públicos
- **shared/index.ts**: Exporta componentes, pipes, directivas públicas
- **features/[feature]/index.ts**: Exporta SOLO el contenedor principal
- **No exportar**: modelos privados, componentes dumb, servicios internos

```typescript
// ✅ Correcto: shared/index.ts
export * from './components';
export * from './pipes';
export * from './directives';

// ❌ Incorrecto: features/candidates/index.ts
export * from './components';      // ← Abre los internos
export * from './containers';
export * from './services';

// ✅ Correcto: features/candidates/index.ts
export { CandidateListComponent } from './containers'; // ← Solo el contenedor
```

### 4. ChangeDetectionStrategy
Todos los componentes DEBEN usar `OnPush`:
```typescript
@Component({
  selector: 'app-candidate-card',
  template: `...`,
  changeDetection: ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush
})
export class CandidateCardComponent {}
```

### 5. Servicios
- **core/services**: `providedIn: 'root'` (singleton)
- **features/[feature]/services**: `providedIn: 'root'` (singleton por ahora; migrará a signal store)
- Nunca `new ServiceName()` — siempre inyectar

